# Mount Hyjal - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Hyjal accept in the local census (123 quests, band 54-60,
# docs/mount-hyjal-census.md, accept key 2482 verified by spawn counts) appears
# exactly once as an accept; 123 turnins close every record that has one in the
# data (121 do; 91696 Open Season and 96077 Belle's Ring are accept-only and ride
# with honest no-turn-in notes, Ironforge precedent). The 13 Horde set-asides and
# the broken 93925 are out with reasons in the census. No race header and no race
# gates: the 20 quests carrying the 4294967373 race mask (Human/Dwarf/Night Elf/
# Gnome + bit 32) are Alliance-only by faction and ride inline, Silithus shape.
# No class or skill gates anywhere in the contract (all null). Item objectives
# with no data-placed source ship as honest area notes naming the thing (R2);
# kill objectives and the handful of data-placed objects ride real completes.
# Soft pres ride dedicated when-onquest minis: 93773 (Moonglade accept, turnin
# Ketharas here) and 92009 (Winterspring accept, timed Hyjal delivery to
# Kaylaena). Expedition tails group by destination with frame switches (R1):
# Winterspring, Stormwind, Thousand Needles, Redridge, Moonglade. The
# 90750/90854 pre lists name the Zet'gan Horde twin 95026 of Blight No More
# alongside the Alliance 92449 routed here; the Alliance pre satisfies the chain.
guide butler-routes-completionist/mount-hyjal
title Mount Hyjal
levels 54-60
zone Mount Hyjal
category Leveling
folder Kalimdor
coords live
version 1

